122
00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:27.740
Yeah.

123
00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:31.120
And you can make soup just like on your own?

124
00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:36.700
Well, I listened to this podcast by Kendra Adachi, where she basically says you can make

125
00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:39.300
