130
00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.300
Pick your aromatics.

131
00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.040
Here's how you make soup.

132
00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:00.080
And she's like, and you can just change it up whenever you want.

133
00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.100
You don't need a recipe.

134
00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.480
