135
00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.320
So I use a turkey sausage.

136
00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:13.560
I use kale, spinach, celery, carrots, onions, garlic, some oregano, a little basil, and a pinch

137
00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.140
