149
00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.380
No, yeah.

150
00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.340
You take them out.

151
00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:47.740
You take them out.

152
00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.020
They're just for soaking.

153
00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:50.280
And the flavor.

154
00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:50.860
Right.

155
00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.560
But my mom would always forget to take them out.

156
00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:53.980
Oh.

157
00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:58.980
So then you'd go to take a bite of your soup, and inevitably, someone would end up with the

158
00:05:58.980 --> 00:05:59.640
