00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:07.170
And then the third draft would be pink pages.

520
00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.970
And then I think it was like yellow, green.

521
00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:12.370
And then I feel like it went back to white.

522
00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:16.530
No, I think every once in a while we got to orange, but that was very rare.

523
00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:17.230
Yeah.

524
00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:19.510
And those were usually loose pages.

525
00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:19.950
Yes.

526
00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:20.910
They weren't the whole script.

527
00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:25.970
But sometimes by the end of the week, you'd have like this multicolored script.

528
00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.090
Well, anyway, this script was all blue.

529
00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:33.810
So I guess they did one big rewrite and they printed it out on blue.

530
00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.470
I don't have any other color pages.

531
00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:40.450
However, at the very end of my script, I have five white pages.

