537
00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:48.530
Pam.

538
00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:50.070
I wrote Pam.

539
00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:52.370
So everyone knows that's your script.

540
00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:53.350
That's so cute.

541
00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:55.070
Well, that was a thing back then.

542
00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:58.370
Like if you didn't put your name on it, anyone might pick it up.

543
00:21:58.770 --> 00:21:59.470
It's true.

544
00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:02.710
Well, I was like, what are the white pages at the end?

