00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:05.830
No.

547
00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:06.410
What is it?

548
00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:08.870
It's my Pam document.

549
00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:10.950
I printed it out.

