00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:19.810
And I remember I did that for season one of The Office.

553
00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:22.090
Lady, your theater nerd heart.

554
00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:22.990
I know.

555
00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.530
Is so wonderful.

556
00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:30.550
And I'm so excited I found this because I couldn't find it on my computer.

557
00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:36.790
So this is now the only copy I have is this hard copy that I printed and attached to the

558
00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:38.470
back of my Diversity Day script.

